------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components redistributed in this repository
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors a small set of upstream C/C++ headers required
to compile the plugin against MariaDB 11.4. Each vendored component
keeps its own license file. Source forms are not modified.

1. wsrep-lib  (third_party/wsrep-lib/)
   Source:    https://github.com/codership/wsrep-lib
   Pinned at: 7010f0ab584ab9cdebb285272a0fb0ff0a5a791d
   License:   GPL-2.0-or-later
   Files:     include/wsrep/*.hpp (headers only)
   Copyright: 2018-present Codership Oy <info@codership.com>
   Licence text: third_party/wsrep-lib/COPYING and
                 third_party/wsrep-lib/LICENSE

2. wsrep-API  (third_party/wsrep-API/)
   Source:    https://github.com/codership/wsrep-API
   Pinned at: 65608d3f503ba9f4c170fc4e01c539be9fafd46c
   License:   GPL-2.0-only
   Files:     wsrep_*.h, wsrep_api.h (public C API)
   Copyright: 2009-2024 Codership Oy <info@codership.com>
   Licence text: third_party/wsrep-API/COPYING

These headers are only used at compile time so the plugin can parse
MariaDB's `select_handler.h` / `sql_class.h` cascade against the
brewed binary distribution (which ships server-side wsrep glue but
omits the `wsrep::` C++ types these headers declare). No wsrep code
runs at execution time; the plugin does not call into wsrep, and the
loaded `ha_stoolap.so` does not link against `libwsrep`.

